    <footnotes>
        <footnote id="F1">Reflects an incremental grant of restricted stock units under the Issuer's non-employee director compensation policy in connection with a change in the reporting person's committee positions. A pro rata portion of the units vested upon grant (230 units) and the remainder will vest on October 1, 2026. The units convert into shares of common stock on a one-for-one basis. In accordance with the reporting person's deferral election, vested units will not settle until the reporting person ceases to serve as a member of the Issuer's board of directors or upon a change in control of the Issuer.</footnote>
